</mixed-citation></citation-alternatives></ref><ref id="CR4"><label>4.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other">Lilly USA, AMYVID (Florbetapir LLC. F 18 Injection) for intravenous use [package insert]. U.S. Food and Drug Administration website. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2019/202008s036lbl.pdf">https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2019/202008s036lbl.pdf</ext-link>. Revised 12/2019.</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR5"><label>5.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other">Life Molecular imaging SA. NEURACEQ (florbetaben F 18 Injection) for intravenous use [package insert]. U.S. Food and Drug Administration website. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2020/204677s019lbl.pdf">https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2020/204677s019lbl.pdf</ext-link>. Revised 01/2020.</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR6"><label>6.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="other">GE Healthcare. Vizamyl (flutemetamol F18 injection) for intravenous use [package insert]. U.S. Food and Drug Administration website. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2020/203137s013lbl.pdf">https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2020/203137s013lbl.pdf</ext-link>. Revised 12/2019.: FDA.</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="CR7"><label>7.</label><citation-alternatives><element-citation id="ec-CR7" publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rabinovici</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Gatsonis</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Apgar</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Chaudhary</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Gareen</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanna</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><ar